22
00:01:02.602 --> 00:01:04.860
Your turn. Say: Lose.

23
00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:08.491
Lose.

24
00:01:09.483 --> 00:01:10.473
Practice.

25
00:01:11.173 --> 00:01:14.461
Practice means to do something again and again to improve.

26
00:01:14.761 --> 00:01:16.679
