37
00:01:44.916 --> 00:01:47.847
Your turn. Say: Cheer.

38
00:01:50.547 --> 00:01:51.304
Cheer.

39
00:01:52.317 --> 00:01:53.144
Score.

40
00:01:53.844 --> 00:01:55.994
Score means to get a point or a goal.

41
00:01:56.294 --> 00:01:57.562
Dara scored a goal!

42
00:01:58.262 --> 00:02:00.973
Your turn. Say: Score.

43
00:02:03.673 --> 00:02:04.360
Score.

44
