45
00:02:06.877 --> 00:02:09.991
Tournament means a competition with many teams and games.

46
00:02:10.291 --> 00:02:12.151
Ten schools joined the tournament.

47
00:02:12.851 --> 00:02:14.877
Your turn. Say: Tournament.

48
00:02:17.577 --> 00:02:18.450
Tournament.

49
00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:20.172
Coach.

50
00:02:20.872 --> 00:02:23.093
Coach means a person who trains a team.

51
00:02:23.393 --> 00:02:25.102
Our coach is very strict.

52
00:02:25.802 --> 00:02:28.245
Your turn. Say: Coach.

53
00:02:30.945 --> 00:02:31.807
Coach.

54
00:02:32.817 --> 00:02:33.678
Stadium.

55
00:02:34.378 --> 00:02:37.133
Stadium means a big place for sports with seats.

56
00:02:37.433 --> 00:02:38.840
